// CotSC: English translation extracted from baldurs_gate_taverns.d
// Original English strings preserved exactly. Translate text inside ~...~ only.

@1 = ~Please, don't distract me. I got work to do.~
@2 = ~If you're looking for Alyth, she is upstairs, drowning in paperwork. Ach, bureaucracy is such a drag.~
@3 = ~Can a hobgoblin drink in peace? Stop gawking at me.~
@4 = ~If my wife found out I was here, drinking, she'd slice my lower parts off with a one swift move of a kitchen knife. Hence why I come here when she is working out of town. Two nearest weeks of sitting with my feet up. Life is a dream.~
@5 = ~Don't even think about starting a brawl here.~
@6 = ~Don't even think about starting a brawl here.~
@7 = ~Behave, enjoy your drink.~
